      "knowledge_point": "Differentiating an Inverse Csch Function",
      "kp_id": "e-8369"
    },
    "q-313233": {
      "dom_id": "step-q313233",
      "name": "Question 5",
      "problem": "$$\n\nIf $y=3\\,\\operatorname{arcsch}⁡(2x),$ calculate $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}.$\n\n$\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=-\\frac{1}{|x|}$\n{{field-1}}",
      "worked_solution": "The formula for the derivative of the inverse hyperbolic cosecant function is\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{arcsch}⁡x)=-\\frac{1}{|x|\\sqrt{1+{x}^{2}}}.\n$$\n\nUsing the formula above with the chain rule, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}\\,(3\\,\\operatorname{arcsch}⁡(2x)) \\\\  & =3\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}\\,(\\operatorname{arcsch}⁡(2x)) \\\\  & =3\\cdot (-\\frac{1}{|2x|\\sqrt{1+(2x)^{2}}})\\cdot (2x)^{′} \\\\  & =-\\frac{3}{2|x|\\sqrt{1+4{x}^{2}}}\\cdot 2 \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{|x|}\\,\\frac{3}{\\sqrt{1+4{x}^{2}}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "field-1",
          "type": "blank",
          "dom_id": "freeResponseTextbox-1",
          "tag": "mathquill",
          "choices": [],
          "dom_index": 0,
          "disabled": false,
          "input_html": "<div id=\"freeResponseTextbox-1\" class=\"matheditor-wrapper-answer\" ;=\"\" style=\"min-width:80px;\n                                        margin-left:1px;\n                                        margin-right:0px;\n                                        background:;\"><div class=\"mq-editable-field mq-math-mode\" style=\"border: none; outline: none;\"><span class=\"mq-textarea\"><textarea autocapitalize=\"off\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" x-palm-disable-ste-all=\"true\" style=\"\" disabled=\"\"></textarea></span><span class=\"mq-root-block\" mathquill-block-id=\"74\"><span class=\"mq-fraction mq-non-leaf\" mathquill-command-id=\"76\"><span class=\"mq-numerator\" mathquill-block-id=\"78\"><span mathquill-command-id=\"77\">3</span></span><span class=\"mq-denominator\" mathquill-block-id=\"92\"><span class=\"mq-non-leaf\" mathquill-command-id=\"79\"><span class=\"mq-scaled mq-sqrt-prefix\" style=\"transform: scale(1, 1.31707);\">√</span><span class=\"mq-non-leaf mq-sqrt-stem\" mathquill-block-id=\"81\"><span mathquill-command-id=\"80\">1</span><span mathquill-command-id=\"82\" class=\"mq-binary-operator\">+</span><span mathquill-command-id=\"84\">4</span><var mathquill-command-id=\"86\">x</var><span class=\"mq-supsub mq-non-leaf mq-sup-only\" mathquill-command-id=\"88\"><span class=\"mq-sup\" mathquill-block-id=\"90\"><span mathquill-command-id=\"89\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:0\">​</span></span></span></div></div>",
          "rendered_text": "3√1+4x2​",
