<span class=\"mq-sup\" mathquill-block-id=\"171\"><span mathquill-command-id=\"170\">2</span></span></span><var mathquill-command-id=\"173\">x</var></span></span></span><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:0\">​</span></span></span></div></div>",
